msgid "The list shows the IPs currently present in the nftables sets managed by the Bouncer, not a direct query of the LAPI decisions. The Bouncer synchronises additions and removals automatically. Time remaining and initial duration come from the nftables expires and timeout fields. The exact time of the last LAPI query must be confirmed on the central server with cscli bouncers list."
